The issue description states that `https://grand-challenge.org/forum` is broken. After a thorough investigation of the codebase, I found no hardcoded links to a forum URL. 

The navigation menus in this application, as seen in `app/grandchallenge/core/templates/site.html`, are dynamically generated from `Page` objects stored in the database:

