I have fixed this by changing the `warn` to a `raise ImportError`, ensuring that the program fails immediately at import time with a clear error message if `scikit-learn` is missing, as requested in the issue. I also caught `ImportError` instead of just `ModuleNotFoundError` to be more robust.

